'''Fiddlehead''' is a raw balanced [[Ashlands]] food which is used in various recipes.

== Availability ==
Fiddleheads can be found in various ruined structures throughout the [[Ashlands]] [[Biomes|biome]], in particular inside [[Ashlands ruins]]. When picked, each fern produces 3 fiddleheads. Fiddleheads respawn every 5 hours.

Unlike some other pickable foods (e.g. [[Mushroom]], [[Royal Jelly]]), each pickable fiddlehead is located atop a fern bush; while the bush has 30 health and can be destroyed (dropping 1-2 [[Wood]]), this has no impact on the fiddlehead - which is not destructible and will continue to respawn even if its bush is destroyed. Note that the bush is weak to [[Damage#Chop|Chop]] damage, but resistant to [[Damage#Pierce|Pierce]] and - usefully - immune to [[Damage#Fire|Fire]], [[Damage#Poison|Poison]] and [[Damage#Spirit|Spirit]].

